# Actor input Schema

## `startUrls` (type: `array`):

Instagram URLs to scrape. Supports: Post, User, Tag, Location, Audio, Reels, Tagged URLs. REQUIRED.

## `getStories` (type: `boolean`):

When enabled, and either userId or handle is provided, the actor retrieves active Instagram stories for those users.

## `handles` (type: `array`):

When provided together with getStories, the actor will fetch active story data for the specified users.

## `userIds` (type: `array`):

When provided together with getStories, the actor will fetch active story data for the specified users.

## `maxItems` (type: `integer`):

Maximum total posts to output across entire run.

## `until` (type: `string`):

Return only posts newer than this date (YYYY-MM-DD format). Useful for tracking recent content and filtering by time period.

## `customMapFunction` (type: `string`):

JavaScript function to transform each output post. Use to add computed fields, modify values, or remove unnecessary data. NOT intended for filtering - filtering may result in automatic bans.

